      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start. i'm also trying to understand the moral weight of the conflict for my script. when you talk about the \"legitimacy\" of the struggle, do you think there were any valid justifications for the French military's actions at the time, or was the whole colonial framework just inherently unjustifiable from the start?",
