      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a really intense take. so you're saying the French side's arguments were basically just excuses? i'm trying to figure out if there's any way to frame the French perspective as something more than just \"lawful robbery,\" or if history has pretty much judged that side as being fundamentally wrong.",
